{'symbol': 'PCAR', 'date': '2023-03-30 12:00:00', 'title': 'PACCAR AND PLATFORM SCIENCE ANNOUNCE STRATEGIC EQUITY INVESTMENT', 'text': "BELLEVUE, WASH.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PACCAR ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS MADE A MINORITY EQUITY INVESTMENT IN ITS CONNECTED TRUCK PARTNER, PLATFORM SCIENCE. THIS STRATEGIC INVESTMENT COMPLEMENTS THE PARTNERSHIP RECENTLY LAUNCHED BY PACCAR AND PLATFORM SCIENCE TO INTEGRATE PLATFORM SCIENCE'S VIRTUAL VEHICLE TECHNOLOGY WITH THE PACCAR CONNECT TELEMATICS SYSTEM."}